    "Support for file operations between plugin-FS and archives (for example between FTP and archives, between different FTP servers, different archives, etc).": "支持插件-FS 和档案之间的文件操作（例如 FTP 和档案之间、不同 FTP 服务器之间、不同档案之间等）。",
