    "Digitally signed": "数字签名",
    "All binary files including installer are digitally signed.": "所有二进制文件（包括安装程序）都经过数字签名。",
    "Samandarin Fork Overview": "Samandarin 叉概述",
    "Author & Motivation": "作者与动机",
    "is introduced by": "是由",
    "Ondřej Kotas (KRtekTM)": "Ondřej Kotas (KRtekTM)",
    ". Instead of coming from a traditional C++ background, Ondřej is a C# developer and QA test/automation & AI specialist who uses OpenAI Codex to rapidly prototype and implement new ideas. The fork exists so AI-written code can evolve separately without risking the quality of the upstream project while development practices mature.": "。 Ondřej 并非具有传统的 C++ 背景，而是一名 C# 开发人员、QA 测试/自动化和 AI 专家，他使用 OpenAI Codex 快速构建原型并实施新想法。分叉的存在是为了让人工智能编写的代码可以单独发展，而不会在开发实践成熟的情况下危及上游项目的质量。",
    "Fork Name Inspiration": "前叉名称灵感",
    "The “Samandarin” name is a three-way pun that pays homage to the Salamander legacy:": "“Samandarin”这个名字是一个三重双关语，旨在向 Salamander 的遗产致敬：",
    "Fire salamander": "火蝾螈",
    "– the black-and-yellow amphibian that inspired the original project.": "– 黑色和黄色的两栖动物激发了最初的项目。",
    "– the natural toxin secreted by that salamander, symbolising a spicy, daring twist — just like our AI-crafted changes.": "– 蝾螈分泌的天然毒素，象征着辛辣、大胆的扭曲 – 就像我们人工智能精心设计的变化一样。",
    "Mandarin orange": "柑橘",
    "– the vibrant citrus fruit with fresh color palette.": "– 充满活力的柑橘类水果，拥有清新的调色板。",
    "Together they promise the same Salamander DNA with a spicy hint of danger.": "他们共同承诺了相同的火蜥蜴DNA，并带有一丝辛辣的危险。",
    "Installation Notes": "安装注意事项",
    "Samandarin writes its configuration to a dedicated registry hive named \"Open Salamander Samandarin\" to avoid interfering with an official installation. If you previously tried the \"tabbed panels PoC\" pre-release, manually clean the legacy registry keys because that build still stored settings in the original location.": "Samandarin 将其配置写入名为“Open Salamander Samandarin”的专用注册表配置单元，以避免干扰官方安装。如果您之前尝试过“选项卡式面板 PoC”预发布，请手动清理旧注册表项，因为该版本仍将设置存储在原始位置。",
    "Origin Overview": "产地概况",
    "The original version of Servant Salamander was developed by Petr Šolín while he was studying at the Czech Technical University. He released it as freeware in 1997. After graduating, Petr Šolín founded": "Servant Salamander 的原始版本是由 Petr Šolín 在捷克技术大学学习时开发的。他于 1997 年将其作为免费软件发布。毕业后，Petr Šolín 创立了",
    "Altap": "Altap",
    "together with Jan Ryšavý. In 2001, they released the first shareware version of the program. In 2007, the project was renamed Altap Salamander with the release of version 2.5. Many other programmers and translators have": "与扬·里萨维 (Jan Ryšavý) 一起。 2001 年，他们发布了该程序的第一个共享软件版本。 2007 年，随着 2.5 版本的发布，该项目更名为 Altap Salamander。许多其他程序员和翻译人员也有",
    "contributed": "贡献了",
    "to the project over the years. In 2019, Altap was acquired by": "多年来对这个项目。 2019年，Altap被收购",
    "Fine": "Fine",
    ". After the acquisition, Altap Salamander 4.0 was released as freeware. In 2023, the source code was released under the GPLv2 license as Open Salamander 5.0.": "。收购后，Altap Salamander 4.0 作为免费软件发布。 2023 年，源代码在 GPLv2 许可证下发布，名为 Open Salamander 5.0。",
    "The name Servant Salamander came from a brainstorming session between Petr Šolín and his friend Pavel Schreib. At the time, the best-known file managers were the aging Norton Commander and the increasingly popular Windows Commander. They wondered why a file manager should be called a commander at all: a good file manager serves its users rather than commands them. That idea led to the name Servant Salamander.": "Servant Salamander 这个名字来自 Petr Šolín 和他的朋友 Pavel Schreib 之间的一次头脑风暴会议。当时，最著名的文件管理器是老化的 Norton Commander 和日益流行的 Windows Commander。他们想知道为什么文件管理器应该被称为指挥官：一个好的文件管理器是为用户服务而不是命令他们。这个想法导致了“Servant Salamander”这个名字的产生。",
    "Salamander was our first major C++ project, and the code reflects both that learning process and the era in which it was built. It does not follow the": "Salamander 是我们的第一个主要 C++ 项目，代码反映了学习过程及其构建的时代。它不遵循",
    "C++ Core Guidelines": "C++ Core Guidelines",
    ", use smart pointers, rely on": "，使用智能指针，依赖",
    "RAII": "RAII",
    ", or use libraries such as the": "，或使用诸如",
    "STL": "STL",
    "or": "或",
    "WIL": "WIL",
    ". Most of these practices and libraries were still emerging when Salamander was created. Many comments are still written in Czech, but recent advances in AI-assisted translation make them much easier to improve incrementally. Salamander is a pure WinAPI application and does not use application frameworks such as MFC.": "。当 Salamander 创建时，大多数这些实践和库仍在出现。许多评论仍然是用捷克语写的，但人工智能辅助翻译的最新进展使它们更容易逐步改进。 Salamander是一个纯WinAPI应用程序，不使用MFC等应用程序框架。",
    "We would like to thank": "我们要感谢",
    "for making the open-source release of Salamander possible.": "使 Salamander 的开源版本成为可能。",
    "The Samandarin fork continues this story by blending the original Salamander DNA with AI-driven enhancements, keeping development moving while inviting adventurous contributors to explore and extend the project.": "Samandarin 分支通过将原始 Salamander DNA 与 AI 驱动的增强功能相结合来延续这个故事，保持开发进度，同时邀请富有冒险精神的贡献者探索和扩展该项目。",
    "Open Salamander 5.0": "Open Salamander 5.0",
    "Open Salamander SDK 5.0 Unofficial": "Open Salamander SDK 5.0 Unofficial",
