      "View source code, configuration files, logs, and markup with syntax highlighting for hundreds of language identifiers.": "Bekijk broncode, configuratiebestanden, logs en markup met syntaxismarkering voor honderden taalidentificaties.",
      "Choose encoding and lexer settings, line numbers, wrapping, whitespace display, and zoom in a native viewer window that follows Salamander dark mode.": "Kies codering en lexer instellingen, regelnummers, inpakken, whitespace display, en zoom in een native viewer venster dat Salamander donker modus volgt.",
      "WebView2 Render Viewer": "WebView2 Render Viewer",
      "Render HTML, Markdown, SVG, modern image formats, and PDF in a native viewer window.": "Render HTML, Markdown, SVG, moderne afbeeldingsformaten en PDF in een native viewer venster.",
      "Viewer controls, persistent settings, zoom, and Salamander dark mode are shared with the modern viewer framework.": "Viewer controls, aanhoudende instellingen, zoom, en Salamander donkere modus worden gedeeld met de moderne kijker kader.",
      "PictView native formats, previews, and thumbnails": "PictView native formats, previews en miniaturen",
      "Native decoders cover formats not guaranteed by Windows Imaging Component, including TGA, PCX, Netpbm, SVG, DDS/DX10, XCF, PDN, 3DM, DWG, WMF/EMF, and embedded previews in EPS, AI, PDF, and MOV.": "Native decoders dekken formaten niet gegarandeerd door Windows Imaging Component, waaronder TGA, PCX, Netpbm, SVG, DDS/DX10, XCF, PDN, 3DM, DWG, WMF/EMF, en embedded previews in EPS, AI, PDF en MOV.",
      "STL files can use the installed Explorer 3D preview handler for interactive rotate and zoom.": "STL-bestanden kunnen de geïnstalleerde Explorer 3D preview handler gebruiken voor interactief roteren en zoomen.",
      "Panels provide STL, CDR, folder, WebP, SVG, and other supported thumbnails. See the": "Panelen bieden STL, CDR, map, WebP, SVG en andere ondersteunde miniaturen. Zie",
      "format support details": "format ondersteuningsdetails",
      "Salamatrix Extension Framework": "Salamatrix-extensieframework",
      "Build persistent, manifest-backed extensions with commands, context menus, viewers, panel file systems, native UI, settings, localization, icons, and a dedicated Extension Bar.": "Bouw persistente, manifest-backed extensies met commando's, context menu's, kijkers, panel bestandssystemen, native UI, instellingen, lokalisatie, pictogrammen, en een speciale uitbreidingsbalk.",
      "JavaScript, Python, PowerShell, PHP, and Lua runtimes expose a shared capability surface.": "JavaScript, Python, PowerShell, PHP, en Lua runtimes onthullen een gedeelde capaciteit oppervlak.",
      "Explore Salamatrix": "Verken Salamatrix",
      "Process Explorer, Hardware Monitor, and Event Viewer": "Proces Explorer, Hardware Monitor en Event Viewer",
      "Process Explorer lists running processes with CPU, memory, user, termination, executable-location, and properties actions.": "Proces Explorer geeft een lijst van lopende processen met CPU, geheugen, gebruiker, beëindiging, uitvoerbare-locatie, en eigenschappen acties.",
      "Hardware Monitor presents CPU, GPU, memory, motherboard, network, storage, sensors, SMART/NVMe information, utilization, and Device Manager actions.": "Hardware Monitor presenteert CPU, GPU, geheugen, moederbord, netwerk, opslag, sensoren, SMART/NVMe informatie, gebruik en Apparaatbeheer acties.",
      "Event Viewer browses Windows logs with localized event properties and XML details.": "Event Viewer bladert door Windows logs met gelokaliseerde evenement eigenschappen en XML details.",
      "Salamatrix Studio": "Salamatrix Studio",
      "Use the Visual Studio Code extension to create Salamatrix projects, edit manifests, design native dialogs and menus, preview them, and generate runtime code.": "Gebruik de Visual Studio Code extensie om Salamatrix projecten te maken, manifesten te bewerken, native dialogen en menu's te ontwerpen, ze te bekijken en runtime code te genereren.",
      "Explore Salamatrix Studio": "Verken Salamatrix Studio",
      "Plug-in and extension catalog": "Plug-in en uitbreidingscatalogus",
      "Discover, install, and update native plug-ins, runtimes, and extensions together with their declared dependencies.": "Ontdek, installeer en update native plug-ins, runtimes en extensies samen met hun verklaarde afhankelijkheden.",
      "Catalog entries can provide icons and curated capability information.": "Catalogus items kunnen pictogrammen en curator vermogen informatie."
