      "JavaScript, Python, PowerShell, PHP, and Lua runtimes expose a shared capability surface.": "JavaScript, Python, PowerShell, PHP и Lua runtimes открывают общую поверхность возможностей.",
      "Explore Salamatrix": "Исследуйте Саламатрикс",
      "Process Explorer, Hardware Monitor, and Event Viewer": "Process Explorer, Hardware Monitor и Event Viewer",
