      "Hardware Monitor presents CPU, GPU, memory, motherboard, network, storage, sensors, SMART/NVMe information, utilization, and Device Manager actions.": "Hardware Monitor presenta CPU, GPU, memoria, placa base, red, almacenamiento, sensores, información SMART/NVMe, utilización y acciones del Administrador de Dispositivos.",
